  ],
  "translation": "Bihain long ol dispela, yu bai kamap long hil bilong Elohim, we long san ol pos bilong ol Pelisit i stap; na bihain, taim yu kamap long san long taun, yu bai painim wanpela grup bilong ol profet i kamdaun long holi ples i antap, na long bilen ol i go nevel, na tof, na halil, na kinnor, na ol i autim tok profet.",
